OL,3,GNEWSATeenager's organ donation saves
OL,4,Afive lives after her death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who hoped to become a nurse
OL,7,Fhelped save five lives by donating her
OL,8,Forgans after her death.
OL,10,FMegan Hilton, from Liverpool, was 17
OL,11,Fwhen she died after suffering a brain
OL,12,Faneurysm in July 2025.
OL,14,FShe had joined the NHS Organ Donor
OL,15,FRegister and spoken to her family about
OL,16,Fher wishes, which her father said meant
OL,17,Fthey "knew exactly what Megan wanted"
OL,18,Fwhen they were told she would not
OL,19,Fsurvive. In total, she donated six of
OL,20,Fher organs.
