OL,3,GNEWSATeenager's organ donation saves
OL,4,Afive lives after her death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family said they wanted to share
OL,7,Fher story during Organ Donation Week to
OL,8,Fencourage other people to sign up and
OL,9,Fhelp save lives.
